────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PARITY MAP (web symbol → native)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  isActiveNotionPath(pathname,to)            → NotionSidebarActivePath.isActive(pathname:path:)  (VERBATIM)
  matchesFilter / filterTokens               → NotionSidebarFilter.matches / .tokens             (VERBATIM)
  filteredSections / expandedSections        → NotionSidebarProjection.resolveSections
  isExpanded(title)                          → NotionSidebarProjection.isExpanded(...)
  sectionGlyph(section).icon                 → SectionPresentation.glyphSystemImage (first filtered row icon)
  trailingFor(to) {dot|vehicle|stale|null}   → NotionSidebarInput.trailing(for:localize:) → Trailing enum
  pinAction(item) {star pin | close unpin}   → NotionSidebarProjection.affordance → {.pin | .unpin}
  GroupLabel "Favorites" / "Pages"           → NotionSidebarGroupLabel (sentence case, muted)
  NotionRow (ps-2 / ps-7 indent)             → NotionSidebarNavRow (+ .leading indent for section sub-rows)
  NotionSectionRow (caret+icon+label+count)  → NotionSidebarSectionRow
  collapsed:Set / filter:string useState     → NotionSidebarModel (tree state) + NotionSidebarTreeState
  useEffect([activeSectionTitle])            → NotionSidebarModel.update(input:) auto-expand
  onPin / onUnpin / onItemSelect / to=       → model.pin/unpin + onNavigate callbacks (P1/S8)
  t(key, default) / navLabel(label)          → NotionSidebarLocalize closure → NotionSidebarStrings (P1/S10)
  (telemetry)                                → view.opened surface="NotionSidebar" (P1/S11), once on start

